proot

libproot.so and libproot-loader.so are built from PRoot as termux/proot
publishes it, tag v5.1.107.80 (https://github.com/termux/proot), licensed under
the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (COPYING.proot). The build
applies include-string.patch from termux-play-store/termux-packages, commit
57401119f9988f79fa095398a9b33b03380222b3, which that repository licenses under
proot's own license (COPYING.termux-packages), and then the patches in
app/src/main/cpp/proot in the order its `series` lists. Those patches are
modifications of PRoot under the same license:

- P1-loader.patch: the loader is the file beside proot, found through dladdr;
- P2-exec-bin.patch: the --exec-bin option;
- P5-page-size.patch: ENOEXEC for a program the kernel's page size cannot map.

libproot.so includes libandroid-shmem 0.7
(https://github.com/termux/libandroid-shmem), licensed under the BSD 3-Clause
license (COPYING.libandroid-shmem), with shmem-tmp-dir.patch from the same
directory: the directory a keyed segment is published in is PROOT_TMP_DIR.

libproot-talloc.so is talloc 2.4.3 (https://talloc.samba.org), licensed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or later (COPYING.talloc, which
incorporates COPYING.GPL-3.0). It is a separate library that libproot.so links
dynamically by its soname, and a rebuilt libproot-talloc.so replaces it;
BUILD.md in the source gives the steps.

The corresponding source of these files is proot-source.tar.gz, an asset of the
app's release; SOURCE in this directory gives its address for this version.
The rest of the APK is a separate work aggregated with them.
